{"id":1061301,"chapter_id":1061301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"朔荒最后的那场大雪中，霁川用枷锁最后延续的那点生命独自走到了她能抵达的最远的尽头，走到了她的离去不会给任何人带来困扰的地方。","style":3,"background":2575,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"//黑屏淡入山洞","style":18,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"山洞里潮湿的寒气沁入衣衫，与胸腔里翻涌的闷痛纠缠在一起，像一张蛛网，将霁川的生命束缚在了此时此地。","style":3,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"霁川","content":"身死之境，竟是这般模样……","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"洞外呜咽的风声已渐渐模糊成遥远的嗡鸣，视线也早就模糊，仿佛整个世界都只剩下她微弱到随时会熄灭的呼吸。","style":3,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"她的生命力正顺着身体的每一次呼吸慢慢流逝，四肢越来越沉，身体的痛在消散，仿佛有一双温柔的手，正轻轻托举着她，往更深、更静处去。","style":3,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"霁川","content":"便只能到此为止了么……","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"她的声音气若游丝，带着卸力般的疲惫，越来越轻，越来越慢……","style":3,"background":940104,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"//黑屏眨眼效果","style":18,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"content":"//BG：古风室内","style":18,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"content":"霁川是在一股暖流中再次苏醒的。陌生又安定的力量充盈着她的四肢肺腑……上一次感到如此充满活力，还是在幼时、在她感染狂厄身患污染绝症之前。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"content":"霁川缓缓睁开眼睛，看到的不再是那个冰冷的山洞，而是温馨古朴的装潢。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"content":"阳光倾泻而入，不远处煮茶的沸水声噗噗响动。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"speaker":"霁川","content":"是……梦吗？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"她伸出手想要握住眼前的阳光，忽觉身体前所未有的轻盈。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"speaker":"熟悉的声音","content":"川儿醒了？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"content":"屋门被轻轻推开，那熟悉的呼唤被暖风捎入。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"霁川不可置信地支起身子，看着走进屋里的人。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"speaker":"熟悉的声音","content":"怎么这个表情？怕是春困睡木了。娘刚熬了金瓜粥，你昨日不还说想喝来着？起来尝尝。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"speaker":"霁川","content":"……娘……？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"content":"这音节对霁川来说太过陌生了，吐出口时都带着几分嘶哑，她揉了揉眼睛。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"面前的妇人垂着眼，目光落在霁川脸上，眼神柔柔的，嘴角还噙着一丝浅浅的笑意，就连眼角那点淡淡的细纹，都和记忆里分毫不差。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"嗯？怎么一觉睡醒嗓子都哑了。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"content":"妇人似乎听出了霁川的局促，关切地坐在榻边，拉起霁川的手，拢进温暖的手掌。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"手这么凉，是不是做噩梦了？和娘说说，梦到了什么？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"speaker":"霁川","content":"我……","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"content":"霁川似乎一时间没有习惯触碰的温度，看着那双手摩挲着为自己取暖，她的眼泪竟不知不觉掉下来。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"speaker":"霁川","content":"我……我梦见好多，梦见山庄的雪越来越大，把一切都埋住了。梦见……我拼尽全力想要让那场雪停下……","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"speaker":"霁川","content":"<i><color=#7683a2><b>梦见父母、朋友、自己信奉的守护的一切，都在那白茫茫一片中消散。</color></i></b>","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"傻孩子，现在已经是春天了。没事了……都会没事的。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301032,"trial_step":32},{"step":31,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"我们川儿怕冷，那就多穿些。等会儿再让你爹泡一碟醋姜，配着金瓜粥吃，暖暖身子。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301033,"trial_step":33},{"step":32,"content":"母亲将霁川拢进怀里，慢慢地拍着她的后背，就像小时候那样。","style":3,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301034,"trial_step":34},{"step":33,"speaker":"霁川","content":"爹也在这儿吗？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301035,"trial_step":35},{"step":34,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"傻丫头，真是睡糊涂了。这是咱家啊，你爹不在这儿还能去哪？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301036,"trial_step":36},{"step":35,"speaker":"霁川","content":"家……？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2570,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301037,"trial_step":37},{"step":36,"content":"//推门音效","style":18,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301038,"trial_step":38},{"step":37,"speaker":"霁川父亲","content":"“你们两个小家伙可要好好长大，别辜负我一番苦心……”","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301039,"trial_step":39},{"step":38,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"看你爹这呆子，又在和那两棵菜苗说话了。想不到吧，草药圣手居然种不活两棵青菜……","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301040,"trial_step":40},{"step":39,"speaker":"霁川父亲","content":"又和川儿说我什么坏话呢？我这是特地培育的新品种，长得慢但营养足！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301041,"trial_step":41},{"step":40,"content":"院里那背影直起身，转向霁川，脸上还挂着那和煦亲切的笑容。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301042,"trial_step":42},{"step":41,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"那正好，拿你最有营养的小菜苗给川儿补补身体，压压惊。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301043,"trial_step":43},{"step":42,"speaker":"霁川父亲","content":"怎么，川儿受什么惊吓了？告诉爹爹，爹爹替你好好教训教训！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301044,"trial_step":44},{"step":43,"content":"他说着撸起袖子，露出那文人瘦弱的手臂来。霁川不自觉笑出声——","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301045,"trial_step":45},{"step":44,"speaker":"霁川","content":"爹说的“教训”，是讲一个时辰的大道理，还是两个时辰？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301046,"trial_step":46},{"step":45,"content":"被女儿当场揭短，江父倒也坦荡接受，害臊地挠挠头，继续照看起那几棵小得可怜的菜苗。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301047,"trial_step":47},{"step":46,"content":"见霁川重展笑颜，江母也算放心下来，照看起墙角的土灶。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301048,"trial_step":48},{"step":47,"content":"农园、草屋、人家……满院的竹制药篮飘出各色药材的清香，混着春日暖阳与寻常烟火的味道。霁川并没有真的经历过这样的生活，但她清楚这一切是什么……","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301049,"trial_step":49},{"step":48,"speaker":"霁川","content":"<i><color=#7683a2><b>小时候爹娘说过，等朔雪山庄的大雪停了，等山下的那些人家不再为天灾所扰……我们就一起去一个谁也不知道的地方……种菜，浇花，过尘世之外的神仙日子。</color><i>","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301050,"trial_step":50},{"step":49,"speaker":"霁川","content":"<i><color=#7683a2><b>怎么会忘记呢……这是爹娘生前，最大的愿望……</color><i>","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301051,"trial_step":51},{"step":50,"content":"霁川神情恍惚地在石桌边坐下，手里被母亲塞了一碗热粥。碗底的温度太高，她一时不察，被烫得一激灵。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301052,"trial_step":52},{"step":51,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"哎呀，是我不好，忘了提醒你了，没烫着吧？要不要上点药……川儿，川儿？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301053,"trial_step":53},{"step":52,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"这孩子，怎么又哭了，这短短一上午，流了两次眼泪了。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"speaker":"霁川父亲","content":"雪释寒峰初化玉，川从霁色始流春~我们川儿原本就是水做的。哭她个千百次也无妨。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"content":"霁川有点无措地擦了擦脸，看着自己被烫红的指尖。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"speaker":"霁川","content":"我没事，我也不知道自己是怎么了，我觉得一切都是幻境，可我在这里感知到的温度却又太真实了……","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301057,"trial_step":57},{"step":56,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"我明明应该在那个冰冷的山洞里，无声无息地离开这个世界，我明明此刻应该已经——","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301058,"trial_step":58},{"step":57,"speaker":"？？？","content":"阿川！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301059,"trial_step":59},{"step":58,"content":"人未到，声先至，一个瘦小的人影从院外冲了进来，手里提着一节竹竿。看清来人后，霁川手中的粥碗险些坠地。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"speaker":"霁川","content":"我明明应该，已经死了。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"content":"那人没听清霁川低声的自语，抬起一张天真的笑脸，歪头看着霁川。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"speaker":"泥娃子","content":"嘀嘀咕咕说什么呢？难道是和我泥娃子一起仗剑天涯的新计划？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301063,"trial_step":63},{"step":62,"speaker":"霁川","content":"你……你怎么也在这里？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301064,"trial_step":64},{"step":63,"content":"那张脸那么近，那么真实清晰。霁川抬手为她擦掉脸上的污泥，又一次真真切切地感受到体温。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"speaker":"霁川","content":"原来如此……所以你也会在。原来是梦非梦已经不再重要了。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"speaker":"霁川","content":"<i><color=#7683a2><b>我知道了，这里是个让已故之人团聚的地方。已故之人，包括我自己。</color><i>","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301067,"trial_step":67},{"step":66,"content":"她低下头喝粥，掩饰自己湿润的眼眶。温柔的粥水滑入喉咙，顺着食道缓缓淌下。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301068,"trial_step":68},{"step":67,"content":"她又喝下了第二勺、第三勺……暖粥下肚，胃里渐渐充盈，心跟着被暖意填满了。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301069,"trial_step":69},{"step":68,"content":"泥娃子在霁川身旁坐下，也从江母的手中接过热粥，呼噜呼噜地喝了起来。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301070,"trial_step":70},{"step":69,"content":"四人就这么其乐融融地围在石桌边，父亲母亲说着医馆琐事，泥娃子似懂非懂但十分捧场地应和。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301071,"trial_step":71},{"step":70,"speaker":"霁川","content":"你直白的话语像是击碎了你们之间无形的墙。多芙沉默了一会儿，侧过身，给你让出了房间的门。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301072,"trial_step":72},{"step":71,"content":"霁川捧着热粥出神，看着身边这些本该早已死去的亲友，突然想起自己很久以前看过的乡野志怪话本。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301073,"trial_step":73},{"step":72,"content":"恶人殒命，堕入幽冥；善者辞世，可于冥府与亲友重逢……","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301074,"trial_step":74},{"step":73,"content":"霁川心底的纷乱渐渐褪去，吹去蒸腾的雾气，她仰头将最后一口金瓜粥一饮而尽。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301075,"trial_step":75},{"step":74,"speaker":"霁川","content":"泥娃子，吃完了就该练功去了！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301076,"trial_step":76},{"step":75,"speaker":"霁川","content":"爹，等我练完功回来跟你一起锄地施肥。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301077,"trial_step":77},{"step":76,"speaker":"霁川","content":"娘，午饭我想吃你做的米糕。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301078,"trial_step":78},{"step":77,"speaker":"霁川母亲","content":"要不要加点果干？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301079,"trial_step":79},{"step":78,"speaker":"霁川","content":"要！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"content":"她渐渐熟悉了充满活力的身体，接纳了这满园的春色，嗓音也逐渐开朗嘹亮。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"speaker":"霁川","content":"泥娃子，我昨夜入梦见到了不少武林高手，新学一招破阵剑法，你要不要领教一下？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301082,"trial_step":82},{"step":81,"speaker":"泥娃子","content":"居然背着我偷偷开小灶！我也是有长进的，未必会落后！看好了！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301083,"trial_step":83},{"step":82,"content":"二人围着这小院不成章法地打闹起来。霁川父母无奈摇头，放任她们从檐下，闹到屋顶。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301084,"trial_step":84},{"step":83,"speaker":"霁川","content":"我这招，叫<color=#fb9259>疏影横斜</color>！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301085,"trial_step":85},{"step":84,"speaker":"泥娃子","content":"那不如试试我的<color=#fb9259>蛟龙出海</color>！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301086,"trial_step":86},{"step":85,"speaker":"霁川","content":"就用我独创的<color=#fb9259>飞雪穿庭</color>拆了你的招！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301087,"trial_step":87},{"step":86,"speaker":"泥娃子","content":"哼哼，你轻敌了！我的打狗棒法天下无敌！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301088,"trial_step":88},{"step":87,"content":"霁川从怀中掏出那把名为折玉梅枝长棍挥起，泥娃子就顺手抄起竹竿格挡。幼稚来回间竟真打出些章法。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301089,"trial_step":89},{"step":88,"content":"竹竿擦着霁川的面颊掠过，霁川下腰仰头躲避，却无意间见那头顶晴空飘落一枚白色飞絮。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301090,"trial_step":90},{"step":89,"content":"一片白色的雪花，就这么落在霁川眉心的红痣上。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301091,"trial_step":91},{"step":90,"speaker":"泥娃子","content":"奇怪，不是已经开春了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301092,"trial_step":92},{"step":91,"content":"泥娃子也赶紧停手，凑近去瞧。可那片雪花很快就被霁川眉心的温度融化，不见了踪迹。晴空也迟迟未变颜色。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301093,"trial_step":93},{"step":92,"speaker":"霁川","content":"或许……是我们看错了吧。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301094,"trial_step":94},{"step":93,"content":"霁川如此安慰着，神情却恍惚。就在刚刚与雪花接触的刹那，她似乎感受到心脏错拍的跳动。有什么来自她意识更深处的链接，在刚刚牵动了一下她的神经。","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301095,"trial_step":95},{"step":94,"content":"她莫名想起了一个人……一个埋在心底深处，遥远异国的名字……","style":3,"background":2579,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301096,"trial_step":96},{"step":95,"content":"//BG：狄斯管理局-局长办公室","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301097,"trial_step":97},{"step":96,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，这是东洲新传来的报告。","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301098,"trial_step":98},{"step":97,"content":"距离你从东洲归来已经过去数日，你仍旧没能从那场凛冽的风雪中走出来。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301099,"trial_step":99},{"step":98,"content":"你动用了一切可用资源，联系了所有能联系上的东洲势力，只为寻找霁川的下落。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301100,"trial_step":100},{"step":99,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这次，还是一样吗？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301101,"trial_step":101},{"step":100,"content":"夜莺的神情已经给了你答案。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301102,"trial_step":102},{"step":101,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"辛苦了，放下吧。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301103,"trial_step":103},{"step":102,"content":"关于霁川踪迹的报告文件已经在案头堆成了一座小山，每一份你都仔细看过，每条蛛丝马迹都尝试用枷锁感应……日复一日，仍旧一无所获。夜莺看着你疲惫的状态欲言又止。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301104,"trial_step":104},{"step":103,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我知道你想说什么。目前种种迹象表明，霁川或许已经不在人世。放心，我心中有数。东洲对朔荒的情况也很在意，他们也不会就这么接受她下落不明的事实。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301105,"trial_step":105},{"step":104,"content":"你站起身，来到窗边，看着白瓷瓶中早已枯槁的梅枝。这是你唯一能从东洲带回来的有关她的痕迹。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301107,"trial_step":107},{"step":105,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我相信枷锁给我的回应……霁川一定活着。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301108,"trial_step":108},{"step":106,"content":"一根枯枝无法回应你的期待，你叹了口气，准备捧起瓷瓶为它换水。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301109,"trial_step":109},{"step":107,"content":"可你的指尖刚触碰到梅瓶，忽然发现——向阳那一侧的枝桠顶端，竟然冒出了一点点嫩绿的新芽。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301110,"trial_step":110},{"step":108,"content":"//通讯器音效","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301111,"trial_step":111},{"step":109,"content":"就在这时，你的终端邮箱急促地响起。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301112,"trial_step":112},{"step":110,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，这是东洲的消息？……有霁川的下落了！","voice":["vo_trial_61301_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_jichuan_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":161301113,"trial_step":113}]}